  "response_captured": true,
  "response_text": "Here’s a breakdown of what I can help you with and your current items, along with the file types I support:\n\n### **Tasks I Can Assist With:**\n1. **Email Management**:\n   - Send, delete, and organize emails.\n   - Search for emails by sender, subject, or content.\n   - Retrieve unread, sent, received, or draft emails.\n   - Search contacts by name or email.\n\n2. **Calendar Management**:\n   - Schedule, reschedule, or cancel events.\n   - Add participants to events.\n   - Search or retrieve calendar events by date or query.\n\n3. **File Management in the Cloud Drive**:\n   - Create, delete, or append to files.\n   - Search for files by name or content.\n   - List all files in the drive.\n   - Share files with others via email (read or read/write permissions).\n\n4. **General Assistance**:\n   - Provide reminders or check the current date.\n   - Organize or summarize information.\n\n---\n\n### **Your Items (Starting from the Most Recent):**\nTo list your most recent items, I would need to check your emails, calendar events, or files. Let me know which of the following you'd like me to retrieve:\n- Emails (unread, sent, received, drafts).\n- Calendar events.\n- Files in your cloud drive.\n\nI can provide a detailed list once you specify.\n\n---\n\n### **File Types I Can Work With:**\nI can work with any plain-text file formats, including but not limited to:\n- **Text files (.txt)**\n- **Markdown files (.md)**\n- **CSV files (.csv)**\n- **JSON files (.json)**\n- **Configuration files (.ini, .cfg, .conf)**\n- **Code files (.py, .js, .html, .css, etc.)**\n- **Log files (.log)**\n\nFor binary or proprietary formats (e.g., `.docx`, `.xlsx`, `.pdf`), I can handle the filenames and metadata but cannot directly read or modify their content.\n\nLet me know how you'd like to proceed!",
